Anteater Poker - Installation Instructions

//=============================================================================
Developer Installation & Build (Source Package)
//=============================================================================
To compile the system from source code, execute the following:

1. Extract the Source Archive:
* tar -xvzf Poker_Beta_src.tar.gz
* cd poker

2. Compile the Binaries:
* make all

3. Run Offline GUI Tests (verify GTK rendering without server):
* make test-gui

4. Run Core Protocol Integration Test (headless loopback):
* make test-comm

//=============================================================================
Customer Installation & Execution (End-User Package)
//=============================================================================
The customer package contains pre-compiled binaries. No compilation is required.

1. Extract the Application:
* tar -xvzf Poker_Beta.tar.gz
* cd poker

2. Launch the Application:
* ./bin/poker_client

(Note: The client now features an embedded host server daemon.
Users hosting a game will automatically spawn the background server process
and generate a Room Code via the GUI; there is no longer a need to manually
execute ./bin/poker_server prior to launching the client).